hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"427","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath donon Eidain ki namaz kai baar baghair azaan aur baghair iqamat ke padhi. (Muslim: 3/19). Baab: Eidain ki namaz khutba se pehle."
"428","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main namaz-e-fitr, Eid-ul-Fitr, ke liye Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath aur Abu Bakr o Umar o Usman (raziyallahu anhuma) sab ke saath gaya to un sab buzurgon ka qaida tha ke namaz khutba se pehle padhtay thay aur us ke baad khutba padhtay thay. Phir kaha aaj bhi goya main wo manzar dekh raha hun ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aaye, logon ko apne haath se baithnay ka ishara kiya, phir un ki safein cheertay hue Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) auraton ke paas aaye aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Bilal (raziyallahu anhu) bhi thay aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ye aayat padhi: Ae Nabi! Jab momin aurtein aayein tujh se baiat karnay, Surah Mumtahina: 12, yahan tak ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us se farigh hue. Phir farmaya ke tum ne un sab ka iqraar kiya? Un mein se aik aurat ne kaha ji haan. Phir Aap ne unhein sadqa ka hukm diya. (Muslim). (Maqsoora se murad masjid ka hujra hai jo Muawiya ne banwaya.) Phir Bilal (raziyallahu anhu) ne apna kapra phailaya aur kaha ke lao mere maan baap tum par fida hon. Aur wo sab chhallay aur angoothiyan utaar utaar kar Bilal (raziyallahu anhu) ke kapray mein daalnay lagein. (Muslim)."
"429","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ne Abu Waqid Laisi (raziyallahu anhu) se poocha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Eid-ul-Azha aur Eid-ul-Fitr mein kya padhtay thay? Unhon ne kaha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un mein Qaaf wal Quran-il-Majeed aur Iqtarabat-is-saaatu wanshaqq-al-qamar padha kartay thay. (Muslim: 3/21). Baab: Eidgah mein Eid se pehle aur baad mein namaz na padhna."
"430","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Eid-ul-Azha ya Eid-ul-Fitr mein niklay aur do rakat padhi ke na us se pehle namaz padhi aur na baad mein. Phir auraton ke paas gaye aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Bilal (raziyallahu anhu) thay. Phir auraton ko sadqa ka hukm kiya. Phir koi to apne chhallay nikalnay lagi aur koi laungon ke haar jo un ke galon mein thay. (Muslim: 3/21). Baab: Auraton ka Eidain ko nikalna. (Khurs se murad kaan ki baali hai; sikhaab se murad haar hai.)"
"431","[AI-translation] Umm Atiyya (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hukm kiya ke ham Eid-ul-Fitr aur Eid-ul-Azha mein apni kunwari, jawan larkiyon, haiz waliyon aur pardah waliyon ko le jayein. Pas haiz waliyan namaz ki jagah se alag rahein aur us kaar-e-naik aur Musalmanon ki dua mein shaamil hon. Main ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Ham mein se kisi ke paas chaadar nahi hoti? To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke us ki behan usay apni chaadar orha de. (Muslim: 3/20-21). Baab: Eid mein larkiyon ke geet."
"432","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere paas tashreef farma hue aur mere paas do, nabaligh, larkiyan Buas ki larai ke geet ga rahi thin to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bichhonay par lait gaye aur apna munh un ki taraf se pher liya. Phir Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) aaye aur mujhe jhirka ke shaitaan ki taan Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas? Aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ki taraf dekha aur farmaya ke un ko chhor do, yani gaanay do. Phir jab wo ghafil ho gaye to main ne un donon ko ishara kiya to wo nikal gayein. Wo Eid ka din tha aur Soodani, Habshi, dhalon aur naizon se kheltay thay, so mujhe yaad nahi ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se khwahish ki thi ya unhon ne khud farmaya ke kya tum usay dekhna chahti ho? Main ne kaha ke haan. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe apne peechay khara kar liya aur main Aap ke kandhay par sar rakh kar dekh rahi thi yahan tak ke main khud hi hat gayi. (Muslim). (Khurs se murad sonay chaandi ke kangan hain.) Aap ne farmaya ke Ae Abu Bakr! Har qaum ki Eid hoti hai aur ye hamari Eid hai. Phir Habshi khailnay lagay to Aap ne mujhe apne peechay khara kar liya. Main Aap ke kandhay par sar rakh kar dekh rahi thi yahan tak ke jab main thak gayi to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke bas? Main ne arz kiya ke haan. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya acha jao. (Muslim)."
